'RectangleCLT.Companion.SplitV4.sparseMomentOptimal' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
Audited 83 sparse polynomial lower theorem declarations, each transitively; only the permitted three axioms.
Full Theorem 8 is proved for the literal K/logK/R assumptions with q>2 and B_n>=2. Actual iid symmetric polynomial models, exact matching Gaussian covariance, actual orthant limit, eventual full-distance lower bound and matching unrestricted/centrally-symmetric suprema are conclusions. Both positive comparison coefficients are explicit functions of q alone.
